{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09667","headline":"客舍悲秋有怀两省旧游呈幕中诸公 · 岑参","name":"客舍悲秋有怀两省旧游呈幕中诸公","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"三度爲郎便白头，一从出守五经秋。\n莫言圣主长不用，其那苍生应未休。\n人间岁月如流水，客舍秋风今又起。\n不知心事向谁论，江上蝉鸣空满耳。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"岑参","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09667.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09667","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}